cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ModelPick in research, cite this repository and the catalog date."
title: "ModelPick: a decision layer for cost-effective model routing in coding agents"
abstract: >-
  ModelPick is an open-source, zero-runtime-dependency CLI and stdio MCP server
  that selects a model per workflow node, prices decisions in cost per solved
  task, and returns the exact provider connection. It ships a 40-model,
  20-node catalog, a decision benchmark, adversarial tests, and a bring-your-own
  eval command.
authors:
